{"parse": {"title": "SK-01", "pageid": 40862, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">SK-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/SK-02\" title=\"SK-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">SK</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.93.B6.E5.8E.85.E7.9A.84.E8.AF.98.E9.97.AE\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"银厅的诘问\">银厅的诘问</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 银厅的诘问</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Queries&#160;in&#160;the&#160;Hall</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1860301</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lapulasidatang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lapulasidatang2\"><img alt=\"lapulasidatang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/600px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/900px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/1200px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>1，2，3……4，很好，都在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌放下手中的演讲稿，抬眼望着空无一人的演讲大厅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>从雪白，到银灰……这里给人的感觉比来亚什基更冰冷，连“线”也锋利得多，仿佛我动动指尖，它就会削下我整根手指。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>唉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌轻轻扼住了自己的手腕，它正因紧张带来的交感神经系统过于活跃而微微颤抖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-307712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-307712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-307712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>深呼吸，北方哨歌同志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>深吸一口气，一股不存在的寒风灌满了鼻腔，直抵肺的最深处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>来亚什基，仍在她的记忆里。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou3\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou3.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou3.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou3.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhengangkou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-618701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-618701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-618701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">镇民Ⅰ：</div><div>您这就出发吗，北方哨歌同志？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>是的。事情多，日程又紧——顺利的话，我也许能赶在孩子们从基金会回来之前返回。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-618701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-618701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-618701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">镇民Ⅰ：</div><div>您要去向那些人宣传我们的来亚什基吗？请多帮我们说点好话呀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">镇民Ⅱ：</div><div>让他们来尝尝我们的鳜鱼汤和土豆炖菜！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-618701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-618701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-618701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">镇民Ⅰ：</div><div>对了！您路上有吃的吗，北方哨歌同志？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这句话如同按下了发射器的开关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>噢……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不用一会儿，怀里便接满了形状各异的——奶酪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>真是感谢……但这实在有些太多了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">镇民Ⅱ：</div><div>是啊，难道让北方哨歌同志一路上只吃奶酪吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>很快，北方哨歌的怀里又被塞进了各式各样的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红菜头、火腿、便携煤气炉，和有且仅有一只的麂皮袜子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-618701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-618701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-618701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">镇民Ⅰ：</div><div>一路顺利啊！北方哨歌同志！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">镇民众：</div><div>一路顺利！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>汽笛声轰鸣，这悠长又空旷的声音引得北方哨歌望向驾驶室，远方的山峦不为所动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>轮船缓缓驶去，镇民们仍热情地向北方哨歌招着手，北方哨歌腾出一只手来，示意镇民们快些回去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海风裹挟着雪粒，渐渐地，连来亚什基都看不见了，北方哨歌这才拎起手提箱，回到了船舱中。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lapulasidatang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lapulasidatang2\"><img alt=\"lapulasidatang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/600px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/900px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/1200px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雪原、海峡、山地、平原，轮船、火车、汽车、步行，北方哨歌口袋里的奶酪早就变得瘫软。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它们已经是为数不多的，来亚什基确实存在过的证明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌撕开包装，却只轻轻咬了一小口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>瞧我，还不死心地以为有人在等着我回去呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌抚摸着充满褶皱的锡纸包装。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>半晌，她揉揉眼睛，又拍拍脸颊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>得了，这不是现在该想的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>首先是自我介绍，接下来是理线学的历史，然后是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>他们可能会问理线学跟环境分析学结合的相关问题，也可能会问来亚什基的地质情况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>地质图也在这里，需要的时候随时能用得上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>还可能会问什么？跟理线学相关的……哦，地脉能量的基本原理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>走廊里传来了模糊不清的回声，音节已经因为无数次反射而变得无法辨认，这是人们即将分食空旷的前奏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>嗯……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌紧紧地盯着门口，随着声源的靠近，两位身着拉普拉斯制服的研究员踏入了演讲大厅的门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">研究员Ⅰ：</div><div>我早就和你讨论过这个问题，你那时候还说什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当他们看到北方哨歌时，四目相对，话题也戛然而止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>欢迎，同志，是来参加理线学的讲座的吗？请随便坐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌做出了“请”的手势，但其中一名研究员直直向她走来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">研究员Ⅰ：</div><div>你就是这次的主讲人吗？一名理线师？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>是的，您可以叫我北方哨歌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">研究员Ⅰ：</div><div>……一位实际存在的“理线师”！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员像是要仔细观察玻璃后的藏品一般将身体探了过去，不等北方哨歌反应，他便开了口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">研究员Ⅰ：</div><div>可以询问你几个问题吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">研究员Ⅰ：</div><div>为什么你仍在研究理线学？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>因为……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌下意识去翻准备好的材料，但这上面并没有这个问题的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">研究员Ⅰ：</div><div>你应该不是只研究理线学吧？你的主课题是什么？地质相关的？还是规划类的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>不，我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只有理线学。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">研究员Ⅰ：</div><div>只研究理线学？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌终于能够给予自己的听众一个肯定的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但两名研究员疑惑地对视了一眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">研究员Ⅱ：</div><div>北方哨歌女士，可是我们平常没有见到过和理线学相关的项目或者课题……你的资金来源是什么呢？有研究方向和产出吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">研究员Ⅰ：</div><div>我几乎没有在期刊上见过理线学参与的文章，说到底，它究竟算科学还是神秘学？有期刊愿意接收你的论文吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">研究员Ⅱ：</div><div>为什么你还在坚持研究理线学呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌尴尬地笑了笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>真是个答案显而易见、缘由又足够复杂的问题……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>脚步声再次零零散散地从走廊里传来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-614020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-614020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-614020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">研究员Ⅲ：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">研究员Ⅳ：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一位，两位……赶来参加讲座的研究员们鱼贯而入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们之中偶尔会有人用好奇的目光打量演讲台附近三人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">研究员Ⅴ&amp;研究员Ⅵ：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但更多的是直接入座，等待着讲座的开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>请先入座吧，讲座开始的时间也快到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员离开了演讲台，坐到离北方哨歌最近的位置上，拿出了笔记本，表情专注地望着北方哨歌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">研究员Ⅰ：</div><div>也许你可以从刚接触理线学时开始讲起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的同伴也随之坐到了他的旁边，等待着讲座的开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们的低语沉淀在了大厅的底部，北方哨歌稍微整理了一下情绪，摇响了手中的铜铃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>观众席的灯光暗了下来，人们将注意力聚集在了北方哨歌的身上。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lapulasidatang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lapulasidatang2\"><img alt=\"lapulasidatang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/600px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/900px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/1200px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">麦克风：</div><div>滋滋——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>咳咳。不好意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>各位同志，各位……同仁，欢迎大家来参加今天的理线学讲座。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>掌声稀稀落落地响着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我是这次讲座的主讲人北方哨歌，今天讲座的主题是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>“来亚什基：理线学与环境分析学集成视角下的地质勘测”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌敲了一下演讲台旁的键盘，一行标题出现在墙上的幕布中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>提起理线学，在座的各位也许会陌生，也许会新奇……但遗憾的是，它远远称不上是位年轻的新朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>理线学初创于20世纪初，在长达五十余年的时间里都埋没在浩如烟海的学派众说里。它是地理学、生物学，甚至应用物理学的边角料，而唯独不仅仅是它自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>那是一幕漫长的夜晚……直到特里斯坦·莱索夫同志的到来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>天才总是令人嫉妒的，他以短短不到十年的时间将理线学推上了从未有过的高峰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>他告诉我们：“21世纪，将会是理线学的世纪。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>对我来说，不止是我，也许对很多投身过理线学的人来说，这都是一句令他们感触颇深的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>它就像是一枚阴燃的火种，让理线师们那段骄傲却难以追悼的人生熠熠生光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌扫视着台下观众晦暗不清的脸，想要从他们的表情上获取到一些他们对理线学态度的信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而人群之中最显眼的，是那个坐得离她最近的研究员，他一直盯着北方哨歌，想凭借她的话语来解开自己的疑惑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">研究员Ⅰ：</div><div>也许你可以从刚接触理线学时开始讲起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>在开始今天的正题之前，我想先问大家一个问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>对于一个学派来说，是埋头研究的人更重要，还是长袖善舞的人更加重要？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>没关系，我并不是要大家现在就给出答案，大家可以一边听讲座一边想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>还记得那句满怀着希望和豪情的话吗？它确实成了我入行的契机。那时，我和我的同僚们都坚信着理线学有着光明的未来。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "SK-01"}}